  description: 'In search of a place to call home, a pirate, a magician, and an alchemist
    stumble upon a great fortune: a chest filled to the brim with many doubloons
    and jewels, enough to retire them early!   Ecstatic about their newly found fortune,
    they attempt to rush back home, only to watch in horror as this large sea beast,
    at instant speed, snatches their treasure and retreats, with the group only seeing
    a splash coming from the nearby ocean! '
